# Stackable Project & Repositories

## Release Roadmap

The issues list, organized by targeted release version number, is the **Stackable Release Roadmap**:
https://github.com/orgs/gambitph/projects/2/views/1

## Repositories

This project has two GitHub repositories, used depending on whether we're building the **free** or **premium** version of Stackable.

### Free version

- Main plugin repo: https://github.com/gambitph/Stackable

### Premium version

- Uses the free version as the main plugin repo, and additionally uses:
- Premium-only repo: https://github.com/bfintal/Stackable-Premium
- The premium repo contains **only** the premium plugin code.
- It is placed in the `pro__premium_only` directory inside the free plugin's root folder.
